        {
          "subject": "Re: Motor IE3 4 kW: framework renewal",
          "body": "Dear colleagues at Vesmo Elektromotory a.s.,\n\nThank you for sending your renewal quote. Our counterproposal rests on our assessment of the growing volume opportunity and the commercial value of a longer agreement.\n\nYour on-time delivery over the last four quarters was 81.1% (sc:70520@2026Q3).\n\nA longer agreement offers clearer account visibility in exchange for improved pricing, while our growing forecast supports planning without guaranteeing orders. We are flexible on payment terms and have linked each payment option to its price; which works best for your approval process?\n\nWe can offer either of these packages - please choose the one that suits you better:\nOption A: EUR 217.05 per unit, payment 90 days net, 24-month agreement, Incoterm EXW.\nOption B: EUR 213.42 per unit, payment 14 days net, 24-month agreement, Incoterm EXW.\nOption C: EUR 214.88 per unit, payment 45 days net, 24-month agreement, Incoterm EXW.\n\nWe appreciate the relationship and look forward to agreeing a practical renewal package.\n\nKind regards\nPurchasing\nHollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH",
