        {
          "subject": "Re: Motor IE3 4 kW: framework renewal",
          "body": "Dear colleagues at Vesmo Elektromotory a.s.,\n\nThank you for your counteroffer and the price movement towards our position. We recognise your concession and are making a modest step in return, with the expectation of further movement from your side.\n\nWe are flexible on the incoterm: under the EXW option, we take responsibility for collection and onward transport in exchange for a lower price. The FCA and DAP options link greater delivery responsibility on your side to higher prices; which arrangement works best for you?\n\nWe can offer either of these packages - please choose the one that suits you better:\nOption A: EUR 222.28 per unit, Incoterm DAP, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\nOption B: EUR 215.81 per unit, Incoterm EXW, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\nOption C: EUR 217.96 per unit, Incoterm FCA, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\n\nWe appreciate your constructive engagement and look forward to continuing our supply relationship.\n\nKind regards\nPurchasing\nHollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH",
