        {
          "subject": "Re: Motor IE3 4 kW: framework renewal",
          "body": "Dear colleagues at Vesmo Elektromotory a.s.,\n\nThank you for improving your counteroffer; we appreciate your movement towards our position. We are making a modest price concession in return and expect a further step from your side.\n\nWe are flexible on the incoterm: EXW gives you less delivery responsibility in exchange for a lower price, while FCA and DAP reflect the responsibilities you retain. With the longer agreement and payment terms unchanged, which delivery arrangement works best for your approval process?\n\nWe can offer either of these packages - please choose the one that suits you better:\nOption A: EUR 224.67 per unit, Incoterm DAP, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\nOption B: EUR 218.21 per unit, Incoterm EXW, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\nOption C: EUR 220.36 per unit, Incoterm FCA, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\n\nWe appreciate your constructive approach and look forward to agreeing the renewal package.\n\nKind regards\nPurchasing\nHollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH",
