        {
          "subject": "Re: Motor IE3 4 kW: framework renewal",
          "body": "Dear colleagues at Vesmo Elektromotory a.s.,\n\nThank you for the price movement in your counteroffer; we recognise the progress you have made towards our position. We are making a modest price concession in return and expect a further step from you.\n\nOur EXW proposal puts collection and onward transport with us in exchange for a lower price, while retaining the longer agreement and shorter payment terms. This gives you account visibility and less delivery responsibility in a straightforward package for internal approval.\n\nWe propose: EUR 220.60 per unit, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net, Incoterm EXW.\n\nWe appreciate your continued movement and look forward to your response to this package.\n\nKind regards\nPurchasing\nHollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH",
